## 8. Success criteria

- Retrieval parity: Sonzai matches or exceeds incumbent on {{sample-set}} (≥{{threshold}}%)
- Latency: P50 chat response within {{ms}} (typically equal or better than incumbent)
- Cost: monthly LLM cost {{equal / lower}} than incumbent (factoring BYOK if applicable)
- Audit: chat audit trail matches incumbent's coverage (`agent.message.created` webhook + KB write audit)
- User-facing: no regression in NPS / engagement metrics post-cutover

